{"attack":"用大钳子或剪刀等夹断对手进行攻击。只要命中就会一击濒死。","description":"极落钳造成与对手的ＨＰ相同的固定伤害。只要属性相性不为0倍，就能一击造成濒死。\n如果自身等级低于目标，招式使用失败。\n此招式不使用通常命中判定：\n\n招式的命中等于：(30 + 使用者等级 - 目标等级)%。\n命中的概率不会受到命中率和闪避率影响。\n锁定状态和无防守特性能够使此招式变成必定命中。\n此招式对结实特性的宝可梦无效。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Krabby","Level":48},{"Name":"Kingler","Level":60},{"Name":"Pinsir","Level":48},{"Name":"Corphish","Level":52},{"Name":"Crawdaunt","Level":64},{"Name":"Axew","Level":45},{"Name":"Fraxure","Level":51},{"Name":"Haxorus","Level":53},{"Name":"Pawniard","Level":65},{"Name":"Bisharp","Level":71},{"Name":"Durant","Level":56},{"Name":"Vikavolt","Level":43},{"Name":"Kartana","Level":70},{"Name":"Klawf","Level":56},{"Name":"Kingambit","Level":71}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":[],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Gligar","Gliscor"],"tmMoves9":[],"tmMoves8":[],"tmMoves7":[],"tmMoves6":[],"tmMoves5":[],"tmMoves4":[],"tmMoves3":[],"tmMoves2":[],"tmMoves1":[],"tmMoves":[]}